  "about": {
    "head": "About Futballero",
    "t0": "Your Global Football Companion",
    "text0": "Futballero delivers real-time football coverage from Europe’s elite leagues and emerging tournaments across the Americas. Follow Premier League icons like Manchester United, Liverpool and Arsenal, enjoy La Liga showdowns between Real Madrid and FC Barcelona, and track Serie A giants such as Juventus, Inter Milan and AC Milan. Futballero keeps you connected.",
    "t1": "Global Football at Your Fingertips",
    "text1": "Our platform spans top competitions worldwide, from the Championship, League One and League Two to the Bundesliga, Ligue 1, Primeira Liga, MLS, Liga Profesional Argentina, Brasileirão Serie A, Serie A, Serie B and La Liga. Every league offers live tables, match schedules, scorers, assists, cards and full team stats updated in real time.",
    "t2": "Built for Fans, Designed for Insight",
    "text2": "Futballero is your live match companion with instant updates, detailed lineups, substitutions and full performance analytics. Track form, compare clubs and check upcoming fixtures across hundreds of international competitions.",
    "t3": "Our Mission",
    "text3": "Every fan deserves fast and reliable football data. Our mission is to make global football easier to understand and more enjoyable to follow. Whether you are checking Premier League scores, revisiting Copa Argentina highlights or tracking your MLS team, Futballero converts complex statistics into clear visuals that reveal the stories behind the numbers.",
    "t4": "Join the Game",
    "text4": "Football never stops and neither do we. From the FA Cup to the Copa del Rey and from the Bundesliga to Serie A, Futballero gives you the flow of the global game in a quick and smooth experience. Explore Matches, live games or discover Leagues organized by country and competition."
  },
